<item>
            <title>[JGVT-4462] Reports_Audit Trail: Experiment Audit Trail - User Interface - Export Buttons</title>
                <link>https://jira.jnj.com/browse/JGVT-4462</link>
                <project id="46901" key="JGVT">TDS - Revvity Signals ELN</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;As a user,&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;I want to export the Experiment Audit Trail in different formats, so that I can save, share, print, or further process the audit information.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;The export options shall be available from the Experiment Audit Trail page and shall support Copy, CSV, Excel, PDF, and Print. When the audit trail is filtered, the export shall contain the records matching the active filter.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;Scope&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;Provide Copy, CSV, Excel, PDF, and Print export options.&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;Export all records when no filter is active.&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;Export only the matching records when a filter is active.&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;Inform the user when the export contains a filtered subset.&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;Use the filename format: {environment}.{experiment}.iso8601(creation date).experiment-audit-trail.{ext}&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;&#160;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;


&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;error&quot;&gt;&amp;#91;Developer Notes&amp;#93;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Use datatables 2.2.2 / buttons v.3.0.1 package&lt;/p&gt;</description>
