                <customfields>
                                                <customfield id="customfield_10300" key="com.atlassian.jira.plugin.system.customfieldtypes:textarea">
                        <customfieldname>Acceptance Criteria</customfieldname>
                        <customfieldvalues>
                            <customfieldvalue>&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;Preconditions&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;Given the user has an active Signals session&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;And the user opens an Experiment Audit Trail page containing data&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;


&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;1) Export options&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;Given&lt;/b&gt;&#160;the user is viewing an Experiment Audit Trail page containing data&lt;br/&gt;
&lt;b&gt;When&lt;/b&gt;&#160;the user views the available actions&lt;br/&gt;
&lt;b&gt;Then&lt;/b&gt;&#160;the user can see Copy (to clipboard as RTF), CSV, Excel, PDF controls&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;2) Export content&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;Given&lt;/b&gt;&#160;the user is viewing an Experiment Audit Trail page containing data&lt;br/&gt;
&lt;b&gt;When&lt;/b&gt;&#160;the user selects an export control&lt;br/&gt;
&lt;b&gt;Then&lt;/b&gt;&#160;the complete audit trail dataset is copied or downloaded in the user&apos;s selected format&lt;br/&gt;
&lt;b&gt;And&lt;/b&gt; the output includes all records, not only the current page.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;3) Filtered export&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;Given&lt;/b&gt;&#160;the user has applied a filter to the audit trail&lt;br/&gt;
&lt;b&gt;When&lt;/b&gt;&#160;the user selects an export control&lt;br/&gt;
&lt;b&gt;Then&lt;/b&gt;&#160;the output contains all records matching the user&apos;s filter&lt;br/&gt;
&lt;b&gt;And&lt;/b&gt; the user is informed that the output is a filtered subset.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;4) File name&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;Given&lt;/b&gt;&#160;the user is viewing an Experiment Audit Trail page containing data&lt;br/&gt;
&lt;b&gt;When&lt;/b&gt;&#160;the user exports to CSV, Excel or PDF&lt;br/&gt;
&lt;b&gt;Then&lt;/b&gt; the file is named {environment}.{experiment}.experiment-audit-trail.iso8601(creation date).{ext}, (e.g. devinternal.GMP000103.experiment-audit-trail.20260813T123456125+02:30.pdf)&lt;br/&gt;
&lt;b&gt;And&lt;/b&gt;&#160;{ext} is csv, xlsx or pdf.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&#160;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&#160;&lt;/p&gt;</customfieldvalue>

